    "description": "Investigates Google Cloud networking issues by analyzing GCP logs, metrics, and diagnostics. Use when investigating dropped network traffic, packet drops, drop reasons, VPC Flow Logs (including Private Service Connect / PSC, serverless / App Engine Direct VPC, and cost estimation), Cloud NAT, firewall or threat logs, VPN metrics/tunnels, or Connectivity Tests for path diagnostics. Don't use for generic VM management or non-observability tasks.",
